# Godot builds to download, one entry per line:
#
#   <minor>  <version>  <sha256>
#
# <minor>   install directory, e.g. 4.7 (point releases share one directory so
#           upgrades replace in place with a smaller footprint).
# <version> godot-builds release tag, e.g. 4.7.2-stable or 4.8-dev6.
# <sha256>  checksum of the Linux x86_64 zip.
#
# These are Linux x86_64 builds only.

